      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This priority happens (much?) later than start of the PD task, right?\n\nAll HOOK_INIT functions (which are called from the HOOKS task) will complete before \"real\" tasks (such as the PD tasks) are scheduled. The priority field here is only a relative priority among HOOK_INIT functions, in this case it\u0027s important to do this initialization after the i2c controller is initialized. Actually HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT might be more appropriate here, since I don\u0027t think there are any HOOKS that depend on our actions here.",
